输入框（composer）与侧栏行的小调整。**0.2.0 起合并了原 `dsh-markdown-composer` 的全部功能**，
现在一个 bundle 同时覆盖「输入框微调」和「Markdown 输入/渲染」。

@jason25417/dsh-composer-tweaks README · 为什么需要 Host 半：- 路由：`POST /api/dsh-composer/pick`（挂 `connection.fetch`，宿主鉴权通道，只服务同源 GUI 客户端）。
- 回包：`{ ok: true, paths: [{ path, isDirectory }] }`；取消时 `paths: []`；
  非 macOS 回 `501 { ok:false, error:{ code:'unsupported-platform' } }`；失败回 500 + 人读 message。

@jason25417/dsh-composer-tweaks README · Requirements：- DSH `>= 0.2.1-rc.0 < 0.3.0` (verified on 0.2.2-rc.1; the host half mounts at app startup).
- macOS for the mixed picker. Windows and Linux are supported by the rest of the plugin, but the picker returns `501 unsupported-platform` explicitly rather than pretending to work.
- The web client (`dsh.client.platform: web`).

@jason25417/dsh-composer-tweaks README · How it works：- `{ ok: true, paths: [{ path, isDirectory }] }` on success;
- `{ ok: true, paths: [] }` when the user cancels (cancelling is not an error);
- `501 { ok: false, error: { code: 'unsupported-platform' } }` off macOS;
- `500 { ok: false, error }` with a human-readable message on failure. The panel call has a hard 10-minute timeout.
